sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Browser
  participant A as Auth routes
  participant S as Session store
  participant V as Protected v1 route
  B->>A: Login token or authorised dev login
  A->>S: Validate and create session
  A-->>B: Secure session cookie
  B->>V: Request with credentials
  V->>S: Authenticate and authorize
  V-->>B: Data or 401/403
